	(text_box "MCP6022 PDIP-8 PIN ORIENTATION — TOP VIEW\n\n          NOTCH / DOT\n             ↓\n        ┌─────────┐\n OUT A  │1       8│ VDD (+5 V)\n −IN A  │2       7│ OUT B\n +IN A  │3       6│ −IN B\n VSS    │4       5│ +IN B\n        └─────────┘\n\nIMPORTANT:\n• Pin numbering runs COUNTER-CLOCKWISE when viewed from the TOP.\n• Left side, top → bottom: 1, 2, 3, 4\n• Right side, top → bottom: 8, 7, 6, 5\n• Top-right physical leg = pin 8 = VDD\n• Bottom-right physical leg = pin 5 = +IN B\n• Pin 4 = VSS / GND\n• Pin 8 = VDD / +5 V\n\nDo not number the right side top → bottom as 5, 6, 7, 8."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 13.97 13.97 0)
		(size 54.61 49.5299)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "beb99017-c061-40af-a911-e8a1a905b72e")
	)
	(text_box "Pololu #4048 carrier includes the stock 1 nF FILTER capacitor.\n\nExternal C12 = 4.7 nF is currently installed from FILTER to GND_MEAS\nas the provisional Stage-B sensor filter configuration.\n\nNominal total FILTER capacitance ≈ 5.7 nF.\n\nSymbol pin numbers 1-6 are project-defined module identifiers,\nnot ACS724 IC pin numbers."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 13.97 176.5447 0)
		(size 72.39 20.3053)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
